<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">Peter Niina</book>
  <para style="h">Peter Niina</para>
  <para style="toc1">Peter Niina</para>
  <para style="toc2">Peter Niina</para>
  <para style="mt">Peter Niina</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesus Christ ii sawltakpa le silapa Simon Peter in — Ih Pathian le Hunpa Jesus Christ thumaan thutang tungtawn a, kote ii upna za ma in a manpha upna, a neite tungah lai kong thaak hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian le Jesus, ih Topa na heakna uh tungtawnin, thuthiamna le thinnopna kicing sia no aa hi tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian ii a nei vaangletna in, ama ii minthanna le phatna nga tu a, hong sam pa ih heakna tungtawnin, Pathian thu sungah a maan nuntakna ih nei natu in, ih kitaangsap theampo ei tungah hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi bangin hong kamciamsa ahi a lian mama le a manpha letsongte sia, leitung ah a om hong lalsak thei cii le sa deina pan suatakna na nga thei natu le ama pianzia na siim thei natu in hong piak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi thu hang mama in, na hi thei tawpin phatna sia na upna tungah belap vun; na phatna tungah heakna belap vun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />na heakna tungah pumpi ki ukzawkna belap vun; pumpi ki ukzawkna tungah thuak zawkna belap vun; na thuak zawkna tungah Pathian bang hina belap vun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian bang hina tungah u le nau ki itna belap vun; tuaciang u le nau ki itna tungah ngual it theina belap vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi kicinnate sia na kitaangsap uh hi a, tuaciangin tuate tam mama na nei uh le, tua teng in no sia ih Topa Jesus Christ heakna sungah a diang zo tawntung le a muibunin hong nungtasak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang hi kicinnate a nei ngawl peuma sia, a khua muna toi ahikom, a mawna luite pan kithiansua zo ahi hunlam mu thei ngawlin mangil zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahikom ka suapuite awng, Pathian hong sapna le hong tealna sia a kip a kho a sua natu in a nasia zaw kanin hanciam vun; tuabangin na hi uh le na upna na nusia ngei buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hisia tungtawnin ih Topa le Hunpa Jesus Christ ii tawntung Kumpi ngam sungah tum thei natu thu a cingin no hong kipia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hi thute sia na heaksa uh hi, na saansa thumaan thutak sungah kho takin a omsa na hita uh zong, kong phawksak kikik nuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi thute na tepteena kong satsuasak tu sia, ka nuntak lai teng kei atu in a maan nasep hi ci in ka ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ih Topa Jesus Christ ii a thiang tak a hong sonsa bangin, hi a thithei pumpi sia suut pal tu cisia ka kihe hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahikom, ka thi zawkciang, hi thute a tawntungin na teptee thei natu lampi a kihon natu, ka hi thei tawpin ka seam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ih Topa Jesus Christ ii vaangletna taw hong pai natu thu kong heaksak ciangin, phuatawm taanghthute ka sisanh bua uh hi. Ama ii letna sia ka mit uh taw ka mu sa uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A vaanglianbel Pa in, “Hisia ka it ka Tapa hi a, dik ka sak pa ahi hi!” ci a, Pa Pathian in patoaina le minthanna a piak laitak, tua munah ka om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hi aw vantung panin hong pai lai in, kote mama mual thiangtho tungah, ama taw ka omkhawm uh a, ka za uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahikom kamsaangte son thute tungtaang ah thinmuanna ka nei seseam uh hi. Tua thute na thupi ngaisut tu pha hi, banghang ziam cile, tua Ni khua hong vak a, nikonghong aksi na thinsung uh ah hong taan dong in, khuazingna munah tua thu sia meivak taang taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahizong, thildang a vaal lai, a thupibel in Laithiangtho sungah a om kamsaanna thu khat sia kuama in ama thu in, a khiakna son thei ngawl ahi hunlam ciamtee tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile kamsaanna thute sia mihing deina pan bek hong pai ngeingawl a, ahihang Pathian kung pan hong pai thute a son uh ciangin, mihingte sia Thaa Thiangtho ukna nuai ah a om ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A bosa hun in mihingte sungah kamsaang maan ngawlte piang hi, tuasia bangma in no sung zongh sya maan ngawlte hong piang tu hi. Amate in hong lalsak thei upna thubul maan ngawlte hong keng tu a, amate a tan Topa nial tu hi, tuasia ciang thakhat thu in, amate le amate kilalsua tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua hi napi in, mihing tam mama in amate paktat nopna lampite zui tu uh hi; tuaciang amate ngamtatna hu in ngualdangte in, thumaan Lampi sia sonsia tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi sya maan ngawlte sia duhop ahikom amate phuatawm taanghthute hong sonna taw no tung pan a meet hong vawt tu hi. Amate ii Thukhen pa sia a kingin zawk ngei zo a, amate a Lalsak pa khanglo zo hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian in a maw a khial vantunglalangte khoaikhe ngawlin, hell sung denna in nei hi, amate tua mun khuazing sungah Thukhenna Ni ngak tu in koltaang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Taanghlai leitung mite sia Pathian in a khoaikhe bua hi, Pathian a sel mihingte ii leitung ah tuipi liimsak hi; a ngup mihingte sia thumaan thutang a hil Noah le a dang mihing sali teng bek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian a selte tung a piang tu sia mu thei natu in, Sodom le Gomorrah khuapite sia meikuang taw Pathian in haltham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngeina pha zui ngawl a maitatte ii paktat ngamtatnate hu in a khuangai, mihing pha Lot bekma ama in suatak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua mihing pha Lot sia amate sungah teang a, ni khat zawkciang ni khat, amate ngamtat siatnate a mu a zaak ciangin, thinngimin na sa mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahikom Topa in Pathian ii dei bang a nungtate, haksatnate pan bangbang suatak tu ci thu, mihing seksolte Thukhenna Ni ciang bangbang daan thuaksak tu ci sia le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a tuan in Pathian ii thuneina simmaw a, a kiihuai a pumpi deina a zuite daan piak tu ci sia he hi. Hi sya maan ngawlte sia hangsanin kisa thei hi, tuaciang minthanna a nei vantung mite a zakta bua uh a, selno zawlai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hi a maan ngawl syate sangin a nasia zaw pekin a tha khozaw, a hatzaw vantunglalangte zongh in, amate sia Topa mai ah selnona taw mawsiat ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahihang hi mihingte in, amate thinsung pan, a piangtawm thinpuakte taw ngamta uh a, mat tu le thalup tu a, a piang ngamsate taw kibang uh hi; amate heak zawk ngawl na theampo selno nate taw do uh hi. Amate sia ngamsate bangin kithat tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tuaciang amate in mihingte ngim thuaksak ahikom, ngim thuakna taw ma in kithuk kik tu hi. Ci le sa deina a thaisak tu ngamtatna khat pawpo suntangin a vawtna sia, amate nopsakna hi; ngualtheam a nuntakziate nuamsa ahikom, ankuang na uumpui tu zongh maizumhuai a, mindai huai hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate in numei paktatte simngawl a dang en nuam ngawl hi; a maw nopna bo ngeingawl hi. Amate in a tha zawm mite sia thaang sung zotpui uh hi. A thinsung uh ah duhop natu a sin ahi uh hi. Amate sia Pathian haamsiatna nuai ah om uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate in lampi tang nusia in, lam amh uh hi; amate in a maan ngawl sepna taw sum a nga nuam Beor tapa Balaam ii lampi zui uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tuaciang tua pa sia a mawna hu in teih thuak hi. Ama ii laa a khoai sia mihing aw taw pau in, kamsaangpa ii mawmawt ngamtatna khaam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hi mihingte sia a kang sa cik taw kibang a, vuipi suangval ii a seamkeak meeikaaite bang ahi uh hi; Pathian in amate atu in, a zing belna mun khealsiasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in kiphatsakna le mawmawt kamte pau a, tuaciangin khialna sung pan a suakta tu a kipan tuungte zongh pumpi lungngul khialnate zanghin aitaa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in tuabangte suatak natu kamciam pia ahihang, amate mama sia lalna zongsangna ii silate ahi uh hi — banghang ziam cile mihing khat sia ama a zocip na khat pawpo ii sila ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mihingte in, leitung siatna thahatnate sung pan, ih Topa le ih Hunpa Jesus Christ heakna taw suakta zo hi napi, tuate ma in man kik a, zosak kik ahile, tuabang mihingte sia a kipat lai sangin a tawpna ah, a sia zaw mun theng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate tungah a kipia a thiangtho thupiakna pan a pial uh sangin, a heak uh thutang lampi sia he ngei phot buazaw le, amate atu phazaw lai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Paunak sungah, “Ui khat in a luak sa ne kik a, a kisilthiang sa vok khat buan sungah bual kik hi,” ci thu a maan hunlam sia amate tung thupiang sia in lak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka it lawmte awng, hi sia in no tung kong laithak a niina hi. Laithakte ngeal sungah na thinsung a om a thiangtho ngaisutnate a kiphawlo thei natu in, hi thute phawsak tu in kong hanciam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Taanghlai in a thiangtho kamsaangte sonnate le noma ii sawltakte tung pan na nga uh Topa le Hunpa thupiak sia na teptee tu ka dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A masa phitin, hi hun khakbel sungah, a nuntakna uh pumpi deinate ii a uksak mihing pawlkhat hong pian tu sia na heak tu ka dei hi. Amate in hong nunau tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />hi bangin, hong dongh tu uh hi. “Hong pai kik tu ci in kamciam hong pia ahi bua ziam? Ama koisung om ziam? Ih taanghpupite sia thi siat zo hi, ahihang simlei kibitphua lai pan bangma in, na theampo kibang lai hi!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khuangei mama lai in, Pathian in thupia a, vantungte le leitung kibitphua ahi sia amate in thusim ngawl kaltang uh hi. Leitung sia tui sung pan le tui taw in kipiangsak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tuaciangin tua leitung lui sia tui taw ma in tuipi liimna taw kilalsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang tu in a om, vantungte le leitung sia meikuang taw a kilalsak natu in, tua a kibang Pathian thupiak sia ma in keamcingin om nginge hi. Pathian a sel mite thu kikhen natu le a kilalsak tu hun, a ni hong thet tu ngakin kikeam zii hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahizong ka it lawmte awng na khat na mangil heak vun! Topa muna ah ni khat le kum tulkhat sia a kilamdanna om ngawl hi; ama atu in tuate nii sia kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mihing pawlkhatte ngaisut bang hi ngawlin, a kamciamte a tunsak natu in, Topa haisaang ngawl hi. Ama, no tungah a thinsau hizaw hi, banghang ziam cile ama in, kuama lalcipsak nuam ngawl a, a mawna uh pan kisiiksak siat nuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahihang Topa Ni sia nguta bangin hong pai tu hi. Tua Ni ciangin vantungte a nging mama khat taw hong bocip tu a, vantung a om nate kuangkeak in, leitung le a sung a om theampo zong bo cimit tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hite theampo tuabangin kilalcipsak tu ahile no sia bangbang mihingte na hi tu uh kisamh tu ziam? Na nuntakna uh sia thiangtho tu a, Pathian atu in a ki aaptuam nuntakna hi tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />vantungte kaanghtumin bocip a, vantung a om nate a sa in a tuithapsak siat tu ni — Pathian ii Ni ngakin, hong thet pal thei natu na sep thei tawpin seam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahihang ko ka hi uh le, Pathian kamciam omsa sia ka ngak uh hi: thumaan thutang a om tawntung natu mun, vantung thakte le leitung thak ka ngak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaciangin ka lawmte awng, tua Ni ngakin na om uh ciang Pathian mu na ah na thiantho natu, na sitbaang ngawl natu le ama taw na kilem natu in, ahithei za in hanciam tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ih Topa thin sauna sia ngupna na nga natu in, hunpha hong piakna hi ci in ngaisun tavun. Tua in Pathian piak ciimna zanghin ih it suapui Paul ii hong laithak bangma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A laithak theampo sungah tua thulu taw kisai in a at ciang a son thu in hi thu ahi hi. Ama laithakte sungah thu haksa pawlkhat om a, tuate sia heakna nei ngawlte le, kip takin a ding ngawlte in ahi ngawl lalam in son a, Laithiangtho hilna dangte zongh tuabangin son thei uh hi. Tuabangin amate le amate kilalsua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahihang no ka lawmte awng, hi thu na heaksa uh hi. A muanhuai na dinmun pan na puk ngawl natu le ngeina maan zui ngawl a maitatte ii khialnate taw hong lampui thaak ngawl natu in, kikeam tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahihang ih Topa le Hunpa Jesus Christ heakna le thuthiamna sungah na khangto suak vun. Ama tungah minthanna, tu le a tawntungin om tahen! Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
